#presentation(size="standard",footer="Automatic layout",slide_number=true,theme={fonts={major="body",minor="body"}})
# Automatic text and tables

Text contains #span(size=pt(28))[large words], H#subscript[2]O, and #highlight(fill="#fde68a")[highlighted words].

- First list item with enough content to wrap in the available frame.
  - A nested item with **bold** text.
- Second list item.

| Region | Value |
| --- | ---: |
| North | 12 |
| South | 8 |

